Z||000013||Oreif||04-09-2000||11:01 PM||||For what goes on, Bob has over 50 cars to get parts off of + he has shelves of parts to buy. Some are new in GM boxes! He has usually 10-15 cars for sale and another 10 for show. I know last year Rodney was there and had a lot of Items for sale. Not sure if Rodney will be here this year. Lunch will be served. Finally Many people are there to answer questions or you can arrange to have work done on your Fiero. V-8 Archie usually brings a V-8 or 2 and Bob does alot of the 3800 and 3.4L installs.||||reg||14
